-Networking, CloudFront, the ECS task definition, and the service are deliberately deferred until the read-only image and reconciliation flow are deployed from immutable artifacts.
+The read-only API runs on App Runner and the static dashboard is delivered from the private
+dashboard bucket through CloudFront. Deployment requires an immutable ECR image tag and an
+immutable challenger run ID:
+
+```bash
+terraform -chdir=infra/environments/prod apply \
+  -var='api_image_tag=<immutable-tag>' \
+  -var='challenger_run_id=<run-id>'
+```
+
+The App Runner service loads and verifies the private S3 model artifact at startup. It exposes
+only sanitized challenger metadata; the model remains `SHADOW_ONLY` and has no order path.
*** End Patch

